as the rrvgo score (\code{-log10(p)}).
\item Computes a semantic similarity matrix via
\code{rrvgo::calculateSimMatrix()} (requires the relevant OrgDb package).
\item Reduces to representative clusters via \code{rrvgo::reduceSimMatrix()}.
\item Assigns each term a module group (winner or shared, per \code{show_shared}).
\item Renders via \code{treemap::treemap()} with parent clusters as outer
